{"line":"result","id":"V72-S2-EXPLORATORY","measuredAt":"2026-10-17T02:40:00Z","figure":"85 cells over five horizons (15-20 a horizon), none promoted, none tradeable; the best cell the median in half-widths for the mid class at five minutes, +0.60% with a lower bound of +0.02%, under the 1% line: a null until it repeats. The per-hour Spearman of the medians with the realized moves across the pairs: +0.035 at five minutes, -0.019 at fifteen, +0.011 at an hour, +0.018 at four, +0.074 at a day.","ci":"Spearman 5m [+0.017, +0.051]; 15m [-0.038, -0.001]; 1h [-0.005, +0.030]; 4h [-0.009, +0.048]; 24h [-0.001, +0.161]","verdict":"held","commit":"a6cb99b","registrationHash":"14a593e0685b"}
